-gauge-choice-topology-relati-8-6f0b41c7e1/","observation_id":"obs_6f0b41c7e168ed9e02a9f7472f2ab24be04c7927e5410eedfa684fa0b3b8d4f7","published_at":"2026-08-28T17:14:58Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这段内容探讨在接受采样的门控（sampling gate）下，代码世界模型在可达查询集合上保持精确而在不可达区域可能产生任意错误的情形。它把缺失的模式抽象为环形冻结模式，围绕可达性、拓扑和传感器分辨率等维度给出了三条经验原则，说明错误的危险、修复的局限以及防御的维度匹配要求。","title":"An Enclosed Mode Is a Gauge Choice: Topology Relative to Reach in Certified Code World Models"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_fbe143087f90b03ca48ec4bbdb00b0de6f00c98331da53c4926b3915d30ed144","internal_url":"/posts/20260829-blogs_podcasts-spreading-the-load-how-salesforce-met-multi-az-ha--0-248c8d39f0/","observation_id":"obs_248c8d39f0ea551419cff5661f09d00bd73d21729cd29d2949b6ae020a3dc956","published_at":"2026-08-28T16:20:40Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"Salesforce 在使用 SageMaker 推理组件部署模型时，通过 API 中的 **SchedulingConfig** 参数对副本在多个可用区之间的放置进行细粒度控制，以满足自身的多可用区高可用合规要求。","title":"Spreading the load: How Salesforce met Multi-AZ HA with SageMaker Inference Components"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_7dd8e05661871b7e967214e13ec0a0b003348ecc505804146d043430f07e236a","internal_url":"/posts/20260830-blogs_podcasts-ainews-openai-to-reach-agi-bar-by-end-2026-0-a425a97515/","observation_id":"obs_a425a975157b3226c4b5570f284ad334db29a53ba2a5f48c90f02d0769e2287d","published_at":"2026-08-28T07:12:10Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一份 AI 新闻快讯，汇总了 OpenAI 对通用人工智能实现时间的最新估计、开源双足机器人、算力优化的本地大模型以及视频生成模型和代理框架的产品动态。","title":"[AINews] OpenAI to reach AGI bar by end-2026"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_c144f90edb18ea51627cac0e95a021d6ea3cfb2f404006cd87ef3853caa380aa","internal_url":"/posts/20260830-blogs_podcasts-introducing-openai-models-on-amazon-bedrock-for-in-0-e991f28971/","observation_id":"obs_e991f28971b78ffc4b870f48aedb48451906a0883992dfde8367c738a304e26f","published_at":"2026-08